1. Pull `skeleton` out of props.
2. Add a skeleton‐helper class (`${prefix}--skeleton`) to the component wrapper.
3. Forward `skeleton` down to the underlying TextInput/PasswordInput.
4. Document `skeleton` in propTypes.

